  lines:
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Daniel_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Noah had a nightmare last night?
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 402a33faddef4364a82a552ee63685a9, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Emily_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: Wait, he did? He didn't come get us.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 67c29a4de37564d47bd3af2c6ec1885e, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Daniel_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Huh.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec1cb9e4e11730f42bde859064bd046a, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Emily_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: Then I guess the unit handled it.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a48ecfc930dd0bf42a8dbd791710f6e0, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Daniel_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Yeah.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5333da06fbefd484d90769b63ecd8f9e, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Emily_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: It's kind of strange, though.
    holdSeconds: 3.0367923
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a7810e90c5a88248a5db9b5b1bfcfba, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Daniel_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: What is?
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca5e0c44ef557674a9e6b9f9dabd36df, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Emily_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: He used to come bang on our door after every bad dream. I got so used to
      hearing that little knock. But lately... I haven't heard it once.
    holdSeconds: 11.716038
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30a9999ed53e36340840735c4e50375e, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Daniel_005
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Isn't that a good thing, though? He's getting older. We actually get to
      sleep through the night now.
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1e6e87a68802d30488b77e77e57613bf, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Emily_005
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: "But he hasn't told us about a dream in... God, when was the last time?
      I can't even remember. It's been, what\u2014a year?"
    holdSeconds: 9.829245
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 942e77b78e610f74780fcfb89f21fa39, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Daniel_006
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: "He was seven, Em. Seven-year-olds tell you everything. He's almost nine\u2014kid's
      got his own little world going on."
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f559ebb342b34aa4998ae5a5e42a2153, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Emily_006
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: Yeah, but...
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 73d7a6bbf2030ed4796ccb17cecaada5, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Daniel_007
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Daniel
    text: Hey. At least we're not dragging ourselves out of bed at two in the morning
      anymore, right?
    holdSeconds: 7.565094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 56897d14f0cc9d949bb4548fe012d6a1, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F01_LivingRoomObservation_Emily_007
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Emily
    text: Right.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7be574a9d48911049a998ea4dd16b634, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
